---
description: Prepare one designTrial evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: CommunityOption[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Turn a promising voluntary option into a reversible trial with clear responsibilities, resource rules, and review criteria. Specify how participants may report problems or leave the trial, and avoid making temporary arrangements permanent by default. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
